@CRM_System.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5283

### Health Check
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as Administrator
POST {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@crm.edu",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Get All Courses
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### Get All Teachers
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/teachers
Accept: application/json

### Get Student 1 GPA Summary
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/grades/gpa/1
Accept: application/json

### Get Student 1 Weekly Schedule
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/schedule?studentId=1
Accept: application/json

### Get Student 1 Attendance Statistics
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/stats/1
Accept: application/json

### Stage 3: Get Student 1 Tasks Sorted by Deadline
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?studentId=1&sortBy=deadline_asc
Accept: application/json

### Stage 3: Get Student 1 Monthly Academic Calendar
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/calendar?studentId=1&year=2026&month=11
Accept: application/json

### Stage 3: Get Student 1 Persisted Notifications
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/notifications?studentId=1
Accept: application/json

### Stage 3: Synchronize Deadline & Overdue Notifications
POST {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/sync-deadlines?studentId=1
Accept: application/json

### Stage 4: Get Complete Dashboard & Analytics Overview
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/overview?semester=Fall%202026
Accept: application/json

### Stage 4: Get Academic Analytics (GPA, Grade Distribution, Course & Student Rankings)
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/analytics/academic
Accept: application/json

### Stage 4: Get Attendance Analytics (Course & Student Breakdown, Status Distribution, Trends)
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/analytics/attendance
Accept: application/json

### Stage 4: Get Tasks & Productivity Analytics
GET {{CRM_System.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/analytics/tasks
Accept: application/json

